    "name": "Santa's Hitlist CEO Edition",
    "steam_appid": 3581590,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/7d04f7aa66b659546d42ff0226cf2f46.poster.avif?t=1749242542\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/7d04f7aa66b659546d42ff0226cf2f46.webm?t=1749242542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/7d04f7aa66b659546d42ff0226cf2f46.mp4?t=1749242542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Children all over the world (and even some adults) have been sending you letters, asking for just one thing: they wish their parents could be happier and come home earlier, instead of working endless hours for low wages.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/a0dde3ca68340885faed0c243c9c617e.poster.avif?t=1749242542\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/a0dde3ca68340885faed0c243c9c617e.webm?t=1749242542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/a0dde3ca68340885faed0c243c9c617e.mp4?t=1749242542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Santa</strong>, it\u2019s your mission to fulfill their wishes by <strong>destroying the root of all evil\u2014the greedy CEOs</strong> who exploit their employees and steal the joy from families.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This holiday season, it\u2019s PAYBACK TIME!!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Santa Claus</strong> and take on corrupt <strong>CEOs</strong> who have drained the joy from their employees in this over-the-top action-packed adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf85 <i>TAKE REVENGE as Santa!!!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into Santa\u2019s boots</strong> and <strong>punish evil CEOs</strong> who exploit their workers &amp; customers, reclaiming happiness for the holidays!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 <i>HUGE COLLECTION of Weaponry</i>!!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide range of powerful weapons to take down enemies in wild and satisfying ways.\u00a0<strong>Upgrade your Arsenal </strong> to become the <u>Ultimate Xmas Avenger</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/ce08cc050879bf279a85c63fcf50babc.poster.avif?t=1749242542\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/ce08cc050879bf279a85c63fcf50babc.webm?t=1749242542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/ce08cc050879bf279a85c63fcf50babc.mp4?t=1749242542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc54 <i>CORPORATE Bosses &amp; Enemies</i>!!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against <strong>outrageous</strong> <strong>enemies</strong> from the <strong>world of business</strong>, each with their own unique <strong>twists</strong>, <strong>challenges</strong>, and <strong>attacks</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/8158eb4782a5fd8ee021577cc9a7c3ce.poster.avif?t=1749242542\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/8158eb4782a5fd8ee021577cc9a7c3ce.webm?t=1749242542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/8158eb4782a5fd8ee021577cc9a7c3ce.mp4?t=1749242542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <i>RANDOMLY GENERATED Levels</i>!!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No two <strong>playthroughs</strong> are ever the same! Explore <strong>dynamic levels</strong> that keep every experience <strong>fresh</strong> and <strong>unpredictable</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an<strong> Infinitely Re-Playable </strong>game in <strong>Randomly Generated Worlds </strong>for each run!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get ready to save the holiday spirit, <strong>one CEO at a time</strong>!!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/7d04f7aa66b659546d42ff0226cf2f46.poster.avif?t=1749242542\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/7d04f7aa66b659546d42ff0226cf2f46.webm?t=1749242542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/7d04f7aa66b659546d42ff0226cf2f46.mp4?t=1749242542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Children all over the world (and even some adults) have been sending you letters, asking for just one thing: they wish their parents could be happier and come home earlier, instead of working endless hours for low wages.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/a0dde3ca68340885faed0c243c9c617e.poster.avif?t=1749242542\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/a0dde3ca68340885faed0c243c9c617e.webm?t=1749242542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/a0dde3ca68340885faed0c243c9c617e.mp4?t=1749242542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Santa</strong>, it\u2019s your mission to fulfill their wishes by <strong>destroying the root of all evil\u2014the greedy CEOs</strong> who exploit their employees and steal the joy from families.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This holiday season, it\u2019s PAYBACK TIME!!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as <strong>Santa Claus</strong> and take on corrupt <strong>CEOs</strong> who have drained the joy from their employees in this over-the-top action-packed adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf85 <i>TAKE REVENGE as Santa!!!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into Santa\u2019s boots</strong> and <strong>punish evil CEOs</strong> who exploit their workers &amp; customers, reclaiming happiness for the holidays!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 <i>HUGE COLLECTION of Weaponry</i>!!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a wide range of powerful weapons to take down enemies in wild and satisfying ways.\u00a0<strong>Upgrade your Arsenal </strong> to become the <u>Ultimate Xmas Avenger</u>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/ce08cc050879bf279a85c63fcf50babc.poster.avif?t=1749242542\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/ce08cc050879bf279a85c63fcf50babc.webm?t=1749242542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/ce08cc050879bf279a85c63fcf50babc.mp4?t=1749242542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc54 <i>CORPORATE Bosses &amp; Enemies</i>!!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against <strong>outrageous</strong> <strong>enemies</strong> from the <strong>world of business</strong>, each with their own unique <strong>twists</strong>, <strong>challenges</strong>, and <strong>attacks</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/8158eb4782a5fd8ee021577cc9a7c3ce.poster.avif?t=1749242542\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/8158eb4782a5fd8ee021577cc9a7c3ce.webm?t=1749242542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581590/extras/8158eb4782a5fd8ee021577cc9a7c3ce.mp4?t=1749242542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <i>RANDOMLY GENERATED Levels</i>!!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No two <strong>playthroughs</strong> are ever the same! Explore <strong>dynamic levels</strong> that keep every experience <strong>fresh</strong> and <strong>unpredictable</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an<strong> Infinitely Re-Playable </strong>game in <strong>Randomly Generated Worlds </strong>for each run!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get ready to save the holiday spirit, <strong>one CEO at a time</strong>!!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Santa's Hitlist: CEO Edition is a single-player, top-down shooter rogue-lite game where you play as Santa, avenging average workers by taking down their CEOs. Armed with a vast arsenal of weapons, you'll face off against epic bosses from the business world in your quest for justice.",
